· Infrastructure Recovery Time ( \tau_{\text{rec}} ): time to return to >90% baseline throughput after a fault.
· Earth Dependency Ratio (EDR):  1 - \frac{\text{Mass}_{\text{imported}}}{\text{Mass}_{\text{local\_processed}} + \text{Mass}_{\text{imported}}} 
· Constraint Violation Rate (CVR): fraction of macro-steps where any hard constraint is violated.
· Rollout Success Probability (RSP): fraction of macro-steps where minimum health thresholds are maintained.

